r/detail/id/3465/)\n\n[Ausable, W. Branch (Section 6)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1240/) [Black Brook](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/4248/)\n\n[Boquet, S. Branch](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1263/)[Boquet, N. Branch](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1264/)\n\n[Chateaugay](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1284/) [Great Chazy (Chazy Lake to Miner Lake)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/3438/)\n\n[Great Chazy (Miner Lake to Mooers)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1316/) [Great Chazy, North Branch](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/5181/)\n\n[Little Black Brook](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1256/) [Little Trout](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1339/)\n\n[Marble](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1342/)[Salmon](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1406/)\n\n[Salmon (Lake Champlain)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1403/) [Saranac (Permanent Rapids)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/10650/)\n\n[Saranac (1. Union Falls to Silver Lake Road)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1410/) [Saranac (2. Silver Lake Road to Redford)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1411/)\n\n[Saranac (3. High Falls Gorge)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/4641/) [Saranac (Sec. 4)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1412/)\n\n[Styles Brook](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/4281/)\n\n**[Google Map of New York Whitewater](https://www.google.com/maps/d/edit?mid=zjdnDE8H0TLg.kJnMWGapL4xk)**\n\n**[New York Whitewater Paddlers Facebook Group](https://www.facebook.com/groups/108070075877312/)**","averageGradie